SUMMARY:VISAP Exhibition
LOCATION:MIT\, 134 MASSACHUSETTS Avenue\, Cambridge\, MA 02139
DESCRIPTION:IEEE VIS Arts Program (VISAP) 2026 ( the arts and design progra
 m of Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers Visualization Confe
 rence (IEEE VIS) ( brings together visualization researchers\, designers\,
  artists\, and practitioners who explore creative and critical approaches 
 to data through art\, design\, and visualization. VISAP provides a a dedic
 ated venue for visualization researchers\, designers\, and artists explori
 ng innovative approaches at the intersection of visualization and the arts
 \, and this year’s theme\, Amplification\, questions: “What does it me
 an to turn up the signal on data\, stories\, and communities that the worl
 d tends not to hear?”\nhttps://calendar.mit.edu/event/visap-exhibition\n
 From Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
